<title>USA: Ford average 1998 prices unchanged from 1997.</title>
<headline>Ford average 1998 prices unchanged from 1997.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ford Motor Co. said Friday that prices on  its 1998 models will be unchanged on average from 1997 models, reflecting  a renewed emphasis by the auto industry to make cars more affordable.</p>
<p>The nation's second-largest automaker also said it was reshuffling  its option packages to offer two basic versions of its most popular  cars that would be fairly priced and well-equipped.</p>
</text>
